# Canonical SHA-256 of every pinned archive that CI downloads.
#
# Workflows, composite actions, installer scripts and lab Dockerfiles each
# carry their own copy of these digests, because they verify the bytes
# themselves at run time. scripts/check_ci_image_primer_contract.py fails
# when any copy is missing from this file or an entry here has no copy, so a
# version bump starts here and the checker names every copy still to update.
